abstract: "Frozen replication of the US geomagnetic-storm reduction in nocturnal migration (Gulson-Castillo et al. 2023) on the Aloft European weather-radar archive, 2023-2025. Three frozen tests all FAIL: a -17% storm-night reduction is excluded in autumn and spring, -9% is excluded in spring, and autumn alone is only weak evidence against -9%. Code MIT, text and derived tables CC BY 4.0. Not peer reviewed; substantial AI assistance (Claude) disclosed."
